# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"The current filament doesn't support the E3D high-flow nozzle and can't be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Het huidige filament ondersteunt het E3D high-flow mondstuk niet en kan niet "
"worden gebruikt."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"The current filament doesn't support the TPU high-flow nozzle and can't be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Het huidige filament ondersteunt het TPU high-flow mondstuk niet en kan niet "
"worden gebruikt."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Auto dynamic flow calibration is not supported for TPU filament."
msgstr ""
"Automatische dynamische flowkalibratie wordt niet ondersteund voor "
"TPU-filament."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Bambu TPU 85A is not supported for printing with 0.4 mm Standard or High "
"Flow nozzles."
msgstr ""
"Bambu TPU 85A wordt niet ondersteund voor printen met 0,4 mm Standard- of "
"High Flow-mondstukken."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "How to feed TPU filament."
msgstr "Hoe TPU-filament in te voeren."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "How to feed TPU filament on X2D."
msgstr "Hoe TPU-filament op de X2D in te voeren."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Please cold pull before printing TPU to avoid clogging. You may use cold "
"pull maintenance on the printer."
msgstr ""
"Voer een cold pull uit voordat u TPU print, om verstopping te voorkomen. U "
"kunt hiervoor het cold pull-onderhoud op de printer gebruiken."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Damp PVA will become flexible and get stuck inside AMS, please take care to "
"dry it before use."
msgstr ""
"Vochtige PVA zal flexibel worden en vast komen te zitten in de AMS, zorg er "
"dus voor dat je het droogt voor gebruik."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Damp PVA is flexible and may get stuck in extruder. Dry it before use."
msgstr ""
"Vochtig PVA is flexibel en kan vast komen te zitten in de extruder. Droog "
"het voor gebruik."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"The rough surface of PLA Glow can accelerate wear on the AMS system, "
"particularly on the internal components of the AMS Lite."
msgstr ""
"Het ruwe oppervlak van PLA Glow kan de slijtage van het AMS-systeem "
"versnellen, met name van de interne onderdelen van de AMS Lite."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"PLA Glow may wear the AMS first stage feeder. Use an external spool instead."
msgstr ""
"PLA Glow kan de eerstetrapsaanvoer van de AMS doen slijten. Gebruik in "
"plaats daarvan een externe spoel."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"CF/GF filaments are hard and brittle, it's easy to break or get stuck in "
"AMS, please use with caution."
msgstr ""
"CF/GF-filamenten zijn hard en bros. Ze kunnen gemakkelijk breken of vast "
"komen te zitten in AMS."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "PPS-CF is brittle and could break in bended PTFE tube above Toolhead."
msgstr ""
"PPS-CF is bros en kan breken in de gebogen PTFE-slang boven de printkop."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "PPA-CF is brittle and could break in bended PTFE tube above Toolhead."
msgstr ""
"PPA-CF is bros en kan breken in de gebogen PTFE-slang boven de printkop."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Default settings may affect print quality. Adjust as needed for best results."
msgstr ""
"Standaardinstellingen kunnen de printkwaliteit beïnvloeden. Pas ze zo nodig "
"aan voor het beste resultaat."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"%s has a risk of nozzle clogging when using 0.4mm high-flow nozzles. Use "
"with caution."
msgstr ""
"Bij %s bestaat risico op verstopping van het mondstuk bij gebruik van 0,4 mm "
"high-flow mondstukken. Wees voorzichtig."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"%s filaments are hard and brittle and could break in AMS, and there is also "
"a risk of nozzle clogging when using 0.4mm high-flow nozzles. Use with "
"caution."
msgstr ""
"%s-filamenten zijn hard en bros en kunnen breken in de AMS; daarnaast "
"bestaat er risico op verstopping van het mondstuk bij gebruik van 0,4 mm "
"high-flow mondstukken. Wees voorzichtig."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"%s has a risk of nozzle clogging when using 0.4, 0.6, 0.8mm high-flow "
"nozzles. Use with caution."
msgstr ""
"Bij %s bestaat risico op verstopping van het mondstuk bij gebruik van 0,4, "
"0,6 en 0,8 mm high-flow mondstukken. Wees voorzichtig."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"%s may fail to load or unload due to the Filament Track Switch. If you wish "
"to continue."
msgstr ""
"%s kan mogelijk niet worden geladen of ontladen vanwege de Filament Track "
"Switch. Als u wilt doorgaan."

