msgid "Select whole model for texture displacement"
msgstr "Hele model selecteren voor textuurverplaatsing"

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Subdivide model for texture displacement"
msgstr "Model onderverdelen voor textuurverplaatsing"

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Paint the area you want to subdivide first - adaptive subdivision only "
"refines where you have painted."
msgstr ""
"Schilder eerst het gebied dat u wilt onderverdelen - adaptieve "
"onderverdeling verfijnt alleen waar u hebt geschilderd."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Adaptive subdivide for texture displacement"
msgstr "Adaptief onderverdelen voor textuurverplaatsing"

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Nothing to subdivide - the painted area already meets the target edge length "
"and detail tolerance, or the triangle budget is already used up."
msgstr ""
"Niets om onder te verdelen - het geschilderde gebied voldoet al aan de "
"doelrandlengte en de detailtolerantie, of het driehoekenbudget is al "
"opgebruikt."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Paint the area you want to smooth first - smoothing only touches the painted "
"part of the model."
msgstr ""
"Schilder eerst het gebied dat u wilt gladmaken - gladmaken raakt alleen het "
"geschilderde deel van het model."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Nothing to smooth - the painted area is only one triangle deep, so with "
"\"Ignore outer ring\" on there are no interior vertices to relax."
msgstr ""
"Niets om glad te maken - het geschilderde gebied is maar één driehoek diep, "
"dus met \"Buitenste ring negeren\" aan zijn er geen binnenliggende "
"hoekpunten om te ontspannen."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Smooth texture displacement"
msgstr "Textuurverplaatsing gladmaken"

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Remesh model for texture displacement"
msgstr "Model remeshen voor textuurverplaatsing"

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Remeshing did not change the model. It may be non-manifold (open edges or "
"edges shared by more than two triangles), or the target edge length may "
"already be met."
msgstr ""
"Remeshen heeft het model niet gewijzigd. Het model is mogelijk niet-manifold "
"(open randen of randen die door meer dan twee driehoeken worden gedeeld), of "
"de doelrandlengte is al bereikt."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Nothing is painted, there is nothing to bake."
msgstr "Er is niets geschilderd, dus er is niets te bakken."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Bake texture displacement"
msgstr "Textuurverplaatsing bakken"

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Nothing is painted, so there are no bake stages to capture."
msgstr "Er is niets geschilderd, dus er zijn geen bakfasen om vast te leggen."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Bake stages (debug)"
msgstr "Bakfasen (foutopsporing)"

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Capturing..."
msgstr "Vastleggen..."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Capture stages"
msgstr "Fasen vastleggen"

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Run the same bake the Bake button runs, keeping the mesh after every stage, "
"and step through them here. Nothing is committed to the model - this is for "
"finding which stage a bad result came from."
msgstr ""
"Voer dezelfde bakbewerking uit als de knop Bakken, bewaar de mesh na elke "
"fase en doorloop ze hier. Er wordt niets in het model vastgelegd - dit dient "
"om te vinden uit welke fase een slecht resultaat komt."

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid "Check topology"
msgstr "Topologie controleren"

# Needs human review: copied from the nl catalogue, check it reads right for nl_BE
msgid ""
"Count open and non-manifold edges after each stage, which is how a stage "
"that tore the mesh is spotted. It scans every edge, so it adds noticeably to "
"the capture on a fine bake."
msgstr ""
"Tel na elke fase de open en niet-manifold randen; zo spoort u een fase op "
"die de mesh heeft gescheurd. Elke rand wordt gescand, dus bij een fijne "
"bakbewerking duurt het vastleggen merkbaar langer."

